# Test dependencies and generated mirrors. `render_check.mjs` writes `sdk-stub.mjs` and the mirror,
# `preview.mjs` writes `plugin-preview.mjs`; all three carry this machine's paths and belong to no
# clone. Rebuild them with the gates instead of committing them.
node_modules/
tests/sdk-stub.mjs
tests/plugin-under-test.mjs
tests/plugin-preview.mjs

# Preview page and measurement dumps — regenerated on every run. The PNGs ARE committed: they are the
# gate's own evidence (and the README's screenshots).
tests/preview.html
tests/*.measure.json
tests/*.scroll.json
tests/*.stress.json

__pycache__/
*.pyc
